# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): MAX_LEVEL either side of 95 (a setting). A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to
# Puissance completed, the Limit Breaker held, rejectedStartLB10 1 (a GM): MAX_LEVEL 95 (not over 95): 10045 (91, 1, 0,
# 0, 0); MAX_LEVEL 96: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
keyitem LimitBreaker
setting MAX_LEVEL 95
login
localvar rejectedStartLB10 1            # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # MAX_LEVEL 95: 10045 (91, 1, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
setting MAX_LEVEL 96
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # MAX_LEVEL 96: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # nothing
